service.yaml contains the code according to which the image in deployment.yaml should run 
selector in service.yaml is used to find and connect the correct pods to the service
Labels matter the most becoz depending on the labels the service  gets connected to the desired pods
  if labels and selector match service sends traffic to those pods
  service sends traffic to those matched pods only
when scaling is done automatically the pods got increased along with that all the pods got exposed to the service
  
